<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>About Us - EduShare</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/favicon.png" />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;700&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>About EduShare 📚</h1>

      <div
        style="
          background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
          padding: 25px;
          border-radius: 12px;
          margin-bottom: 20px;
        "
      >
        <h2 style="color: #94f0ff; margin-bottom: 15px">Our Mission</h2>
        <p>
          EduShare is dedicated to creating a vibrant community where students
          and teachers can freely share educational resources. We believe that
          knowledge grows when shared, and books should be accessible to
          everyone who seeks to learn.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        style="
          background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
          padding: 25px;
          border-radius: 12px;
          margin-bottom: 20px;
        "
      >
        <h2 style="color: #94f0ff; margin-bottom: 15px">What We Offer</h2>
        <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0">
          <li style="padding: 10px 0">
            📖 <strong>Book Sharing:</strong> Share your books with fellow
            learners and borrow from others
          </li>
          <li style="padding: 10px 0">
            📝 <strong>Notes Collaboration:</strong> Add and access study notes
            for books you've borrowed
          </li>
          <li style="padding: 10px 0">
            ⭐ <strong>Review System:</strong> Rate and review books to help
            others make informed choices
          </li>
          <li style="padding: 10px 0">
            🌟 <strong>Trust Ratings:</strong> Build a reputation as a reliable
            member of the community
          </li>
          <li style="padding: 10px 0">
            🤝 <strong>Safe Transactions:</strong> Organized borrow/return
            request system
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div
        style="
          background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
          padding: 25px;
          border-radius: 12px;
          margin-bottom: 20px;
        "
      >
        <h2 style="color: #94f0ff; margin-bottom: 15px">How It Works</h2>
        <ol style="padding-left: 20px">
          <li style="padding: 8px 0">
            Create your account as a student or teacher
          </li>
          <li style="padding: 8px 0">Add books from your personal library</li>
          <li style="padding: 8px 0">Browse books from other members</li>
          <li style="padding: 8px 0">
            Send borrow requests for books you need
          </li>
          <li style="padding: 8px 0">
            Share notes and reviews with the community
          </li>
          <li style="padding: 8px 0">
            Build your trust rating through responsible sharing
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div
        style="
          background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
          padding: 25px;
          border-radius: 12px;
          margin-bottom: 20px;
        "
      >
        <h2 style="color: #94f0ff; margin-bottom: 15px">Our Values</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>Community:</strong> We foster a supportive environment where
          knowledge sharing is celebrated.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Trust:</strong> Our rating system ensures accountability and
          builds confidence in the community.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Accessibility:</strong> Making educational resources available
          to everyone, regardless of financial constraints.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Collaboration:</strong> Encouraging learners to help each
          other through notes and reviews.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        style="
          background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
          padding: 25px;
          border-radius: 12px;
          margin-bottom: 20px;
        "
      >
        <h2 style="color: #94f0ff; margin-bottom: 15px">Join Our Community</h2>
        <p>
          Whether you're a student looking for study materials or a teacher
          wanting to share resources, EduShare is the perfect platform for you.
          Join thousands of learners who are already sharing knowledge and
          building connections.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px">
        <a href="/login" class="button" style="margin-right: 10px">
          Get Started
        </a>
        <a
          href="/"
          class="button"
          style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2)"
        >
          Back to Home
        </a>
      </div>

      <div
        style="
          text-align: center;
          margin-top: 40px;
          padding: 20px;
          background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
          border-radius: 12px;
        "
      >
        <h3 style="color: #94f0ff; margin-bottom: 10px">Contact Us</h3>
        <p>Have questions or feedback? We'd love to hear from you!</p>
        <p>
          Email:
          <a href="mailto:support@edushare.com" style="color: #94f0ff"
            >support@edushare.com</a
          >
        </p>
      </div>
    </main>

    <footer>&copy; 2024 EduShare. All rights reserved.</footer>
  </body>
</html>
